                                                "sense_id": "e72ea72f-2ed0-3bcf-be11-9cb690dd6df1",
                                                "text": "“The NPT is not able to protect us, so why a country like Iran, or other countries interested to have a peaceful nuclear energy, should rely on NPT,” the Iranian foreign minister, Abbas Araghchi, told a conference in Istanbul on Sunday."
                                            },
                                            {
