                                                "sense_id": "e72ea72f-2ed0-3bcf-be11-9cb690dd6df1",
                                                "text": "Iran’s parliament passed a bill halting cooperation with the UN nuclear watchdog, while the Foreign Minister, Abbas Araghchi, also said that the country could also rethink its membership of the Non-Proliferation Treaty (NPT), which prohibits signatories from developing nuclear weapons."
